# kromacut
===
 Open-source HueForge-style tool for turning images into stacked, color-layered 3D prints. Optimize filament order with physics-based auto-painting, preview every layer in 2D and 3D, calibrate filament hiding distance, and export print-ready STL or 3MF files.
